<title>USA: First Pacific seeks bankruptcy protection.</title>
<headline>First Pacific seeks bankruptcy protection.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific Networks Inc said Tuesday it had filed a voluntary petition for bankruptcy protection and reorganization under Chapter 11 of the federal bankruptcy law.</p>
<p>At the same time, it said it has directed management to evaluate all proposals regarding the sale, acquisition or merger of the company.</p>
